    "title": "Logo Master - Design & Maker",
    "description": "Want to design and make a logo yourself? logo master is definitely your best choice.\r\n\r\nLogo Master has tons of materials that you can use for free.\r\nIncluding but not limited to:\r\n~A lot of background image resources;\r\n~A lot of graphic logo resources;\r\n~ Lots of shape resources;\r\n\r\nLogo Master has the following features:\r\n~Change the color of the logo and freely scale the size;\r\n~You can add multiple logos and set levels;\r\n~You can change the background to a solid color or a picture;\r\n~You can modify the shape of the logo;\r\n~ You can add text and scale the size freely.",
